"<h3><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 12, 2026</p>\n<p>Vertex Quant (“we,” “our,” or “us”) respects your privacy.\nThis Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect your personal information when you use the Vertex Quant platform and related services.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>1.1 Account and Identity Information</strong></h3>\n<p>Email address</p>\n<p>Encrypted account password</p>\n<p>Registration and login timestamps and related records</p>\n<h4><strong>1.2 Verification and Security Information</strong></h4>\n<p>Verification code delivery and validation records</p>\n<p>Security-related logs used for abuse prevention, abnormal login detection, and risk control</p>\n<h3><strong>1.3 Usage and Device Information</strong></h3>\n<p>IP address</p>\n<p>Browser type and device information</p>\n<p>Access records and error logs for system security and troubleshooting purposes</p>\n<h4><strong>1.4 Strategy and Trading-Related Information (When Automated Execution Is Enabled)</strong></h4>\n<p>Strategy subscription relationships</p>\n<p>Order instruction records</p>\n<p>Execution results and system error information</p>\n<p>Such information is collected solely for displaying strategy execution status, system operation monitoring, and issue diagnostics.\nVertex Quant does <strong>not</strong> have direct control over, custody of, or access to your trading account funds.</p>\n<h3><strong>1.5 Local Storage</strong></h3>\n<p>To maintain login sessions and improve user experience, we may store necessary information such as authentication tokens in your local browser storage.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<p><strong>2. Automated Execution and Account Control (Important)</strong></p>\n<p>Vertex Quant is a technology platform for strategy sharing and automated execution.\nWe do <strong>not</strong> directly log into, manually operate, or intervene in your trading account.</p>\n<p>When you choose to enable automated execution:</p>\n<p>Trading instructions are automatically generated by the system based on the rules of the strategies you subscribe to;</p>\n<p>Instructions are transmitted and executed via third-party trading platforms authorized by you;</p>\n<p>We do not access, hold, transfer, or withdraw your funds;</p>\n<p>We do not have the ability to independently modify or manually control your account’s trading behavior.</p>\n<p>You may revoke authorization or stop automated execution at any time through the third-party trading platform or this platform.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>3. How We Use Information</strong></h3>\n<p>We may use collected information for the following purposes:</p>\n<p>Providing and maintaining platform services (e.g., registration, login, strategy subscription, execution status display);</p>\n<p>Sending transactional notifications (e.g., verification codes, security alerts);</p>\n<p>Security protection, anti-abuse measures, risk control, and system audits;</p>\n<p>Improving product experience and troubleshooting system issues;</p>\n<p>Complying with applicable laws and regulatory obligations.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>4. How We Share Information</strong></h3>\n<p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information.\nWithin the scope necessary to provide services, we may share relevant information with the following third parties:</p>\n<p><strong>Email service providers</strong> (e.g., Mailgun):\nUsed for sending verification codes and system notifications (involving email addresses and delivery status).</p>\n<p><strong>Cloud infrastructure providers</strong> (e.g., AWS):\nUsed to deploy and operate platform services and may process system logs and operational data.</p>\n<p><strong>Third-party trading platforms or execution interfaces:</strong>\nWhen automated execution is enabled, relevant order instructions are transmitted to platforms authorized by you for execution.</p>\n<p><strong>Legal and compliance requirements:</strong>\nInformation may be disclosed when required by law or to protect the legitimate rights and interests of the platform and its users.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>5. Cross-Border Data Transfers</strong></h3>\n<p>As we may use cloud and email services located in different countries or regions, your personal information may be processed outside your jurisdiction.</p>\n<p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to ensure that third-party service providers offer a level of protection no less than that required under this Privacy Policy.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>6. Data Retention</strong></h3>\n<p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this Privacy Policy or as required by applicable laws and regulations.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>7. Security Measures</strong></h3>\n<p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect your personal information, including but not limited to:</p>\n<p>HTTPS encrypted transmission</p>\n<p>Access control mechanisms</p>\n<p>Logging and security audits</p>\n<p>However, no system can guarantee absolute security.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>8. Your Rights</strong></h3>\n<p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, you have the right to:</p>\n<p>Access your personal information held by us;</p>\n<p>Correct inaccurate or incomplete information;</p>\n<p>Request deletion of your account information where legally permitted.</p>\n<p>You may submit such requests using the contact information provided below.\nWe may need to verify your identity before processing your request.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>9. Minors</strong></h3>\n<p>Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of 18.\nIf we become aware that we have inadvertently collected personal information from a minor, we will delete such information.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>10. Updates to This Privacy Policy</strong></h3>\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to improve our services or reflect legal and regulatory changes.\nIf material changes occur, we will notify you through platform announcements or other reasonable means.</p>\n<p>Continued use of our services constitutes your acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.</p>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<h3><strong>11. Contact Information</strong></h3>\n<p>If you have any questions, comments, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or personal information processing, please contact:</p>\n<h3>📧 <strong>249227740+Cheny099@users.noreply.github.com</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>\n<div class=\"h-4\"></div>"